          "locator": "Appendix H.1"
        }
      ],
      "article_quote": "动作发出前检查条件、必要时拦截的这段代码称为 <strong>guard</strong>，例如必须选好颜色后才允许购买。"
    },
    {
      "term": "transductive objective",
      "kind": "loss",
      "source_ids": [
